		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 17,
			22</span></i>. 35, § 183.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>that has been
				married only once</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Joseph,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Monog. 6 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
